# Replace every <PLACEHOLDER>. See README.md, section "Placeholders". (muas Mosl macha)
# Add the two handle blocks to the existing site block of <API_DOMAIN>, or use the block as a new one. (muas Mosl macha)
# Caddy sets X-Forwarded-For itself, so TRUST_PROXY=1 in the service file is safe.
<API_DOMAIN> {
    handle /feedback* {
        reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:<PORT>
    }
    handle /health {
        reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:<PORT>
    }
}
